cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SurroSim in research, teaching, or a published evaluation, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "SurroSim: trustworthy surrogate models for structural finite-element analysis"
abstract: >-
  SurroSim is a reproducible engineering-AI platform that trains fast surrogate
  models for parametric cantilever families from gated CalculiX finite-element
  data, and keeps every prediction traceable to validated simulation evidence.
  It covers design sampling, geometry and meshing, solver automation, dataset
  gating, scalar and graph-neural-network models, a FastAPI service, and a
  React engineering application.
type: software
